{
  "title": "Dog Registration",
  "description": "Apply to register a new dog with Hutt City Council or transfer registration from another council.",
  "showProgressBar": "top",
  "progressBarType": "pages",
  "showQuestionNumbers": "off",
  "completeText": "Submit",
  "completedHtml": "<h3>Application completed</h3><p>This prototype does not send your application to Hutt City Council.</p>",
  "calculatedValues": [
    {
      "name": "d1_displayName",
      "expression": "iif({d1_name} notempty, {d1_name}, 'your dog')"
    },
    {
      "name": "d2_displayName",
      "expression": "iif({d2_name} notempty, {d2_name}, 'your dog')"
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "info",
      "title": "Information",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "i1",
          "html": "<h3>Register a new dog</h3>"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "i2",
          "html": "<p>Use this form to apply to register your new dog with Hutt City Council, or to transfer your dog&#39;s registration from another area.<br><br>Once we have processed your application, we&#39;ll email or post you an invoice with a link to our online payments page. We will send your dog tag once payment is received. If your dog&#39;s registration for this year has already been paid to another council we will post you a tag free of charge.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "i3",
          "html": "<p>Privacy statement<br>We collect the owner&#39;s name, date of birth, address and contact details as required under the Dog Control Act (1996). This information will be shared with the National Dog Database operated by the Department of Internal Affairs.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "i4",
          "html": "<p>Before you start – if applicable you will need copies of your dog&#39;s: microchip number, desexing certification, proof of adoption (SPCA/HUHA), import proof of arrival, disability assist dog certification, and details of registration with another council.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "own",
      "title": "Primary Owner",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "p1",
          "html": "<h3>Your details</h3>"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "p2",
          "html": "<p>You will be the person responsible for your dog/s fees and invoices.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "fn",
          "title": "First Name",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "ln",
          "title": "Last Name",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "dob",
          "title": "Date of Birth",
          "isRequired": true,
          "description": "You must be at least 16 years old to be the registered owner of a dog.",
          "inputType": "date"
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "a0",
          "html": "<h3>Address where the dog/s will live</h3>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "st",
          "title": "Street address",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "st2",
          "title": "Street Address line 2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sub",
          "title": "Suburb",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "state",
          "title": "State"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "pc",
          "title": "Postcode",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "name": "cty",
          "title": "Country",
          "description": "Your dog/s must live in Lower Hutt. If you live elsewhere, please complete a registration form with your local council.",
          "choices": [
            "Australia",
            "Canada",
            "India",
            "Ireland",
            "New Zealand",
            "South Africa",
            "United Kingdom",
            "United States"
          ],
          "defaultValue": "New Zealand",
          "placeholder": "Please select"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "post",
          "title": "Postal address (if different)"
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "cnt",
          "title": "How many dogs are living on your property now?",
          "isRequired": true,
          "description": "This includes the new dog being registered.",
          "choices": [
            "1",
            "2",
            "3+"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "lic",
          "html": "<p>If you live in an urban area and want to keep more than 2 dogs over 3 months old, you will also need a special licence and to pay a fee. You can apply online – a link will be sent on completion of this form.</p>",
          "visibleIf": "{cnt} = \"3+\""
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "ph",
          "title": "Contact Number",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "em",
          "title": "Email address"
        },
        {
          "type": "boolean",
          "name": "inv",
          "title": "Would you like to receive your annual registration invoice by email?",
          "renderAs": "checkbox"
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "prev",
          "title": "Do you, or have you ever, had a dog registered with Hutt City Council?",
          "isRequired": true,
          "choices": [
            "Yes",
            "No"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "dn",
          "title": "Dog name",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "sec",
          "title": "Would you like to add a secondary owner?",
          "isRequired": true,
          "choices": [
            "Yes",
            "No"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "so",
      "title": "Secondary Owner",
      "visibleIf": "{sec} = \"Yes\"",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "s0",
          "html": "<p>This person will be a registered owner for your dog/s, but will not be responsible for fees and invoices. This form must be filled out by the Primary Owner/Fee Payer.</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sfn",
          "title": "First name",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sln",
          "title": "Last name",
          "isRequired": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sdob",
          "title": "Date of Birth",
          "isRequired": true,
          "inputType": "date"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sem",
          "title": "Email address"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "sph",
          "title": "Contact number",
          "isRequired": true
        }
      ]
    },
